<resources>
    <!-- Microns per pixel, used by UdfpsOverlayInteractor to size the lockscreen
         UDFPS icon:  iconSize = udfps_icon_size (6000 um) / pixel_pitch.

         AOSP's default is -1, a "must override per device" sentinel. Left at -1
         the icon size goes negative and the stroked ic_fingerprint vector
         collapses into a white rounded blob over the background circle.

         This panel (BF237_RM692H5_6P8) is 1216 px across 72 mm:
             72000 um / 1216 px = 59.21 um/px
             xDpi = 1216 / (72/25.4) = 428.98   (yDpi = 2688 / (158/25.4) = 432.1)
         Same value the NX809J port arrived at independently. -->
    <item name="pixel_pitch" format="float" type="dimen">59.2</item>
</resources>
